6. Test fixtures (fixtures/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fixtures/pdf/manifest.json lists every fixture PDF with its source URL, license and the evidence
for that license. The PDFs are not committed; fixtures/pdf/fetch.mjs downloads them from the
source URLs into a local cache. The manifest records these licenses:

  CC BY 4.0           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  CC BY-SA 4.0        https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  Public domain       official works (par. 5 UrhG, 17 USC 105) and works whose author died
                      before 1950

The converted texts in fixtures/retrieval/corpus are adaptations of the following CC BY 4.0
works (converted from PDF to text and split into sections). Authors are listed as in
fixtures/retrieval/items.json; "et al." marks further authors of the original.

  Kwiatkowski, Palomaki, Redfield et al.: Natural Questions: A Benchmark for Question Answering
    Research. Transactions of the ACL, 2019. https://doi.org/10.1162/tacl_a_00276
    Source: https://aclanthology.org/Q19-1026.pdf
  Klein, Van de Sompel, Sanderson et al.: Scholarly Context Not Found: One in Five Articles
    Suffers from Reference Rot. PLOS ONE, 2014. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0115253
    Source: https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article/file?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0115253&type=printable
  Jiang, Sablayrolles, Mensch et al.: Mistral 7B. arXiv:2310.06825, 2023.
    https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2310.06825  Source: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2310.06825v1
  Auer, Lysak, Nassar et al.: Docling Technical Report. arXiv:2408.09869, 2024.
    https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2408.09869  Source: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2408.09869v5
  Rieckmann, Marco: Bildung fuer nachhaltige Entwicklung: Ziele, didaktische Prinzipien und
    Methoden. merz, 2021. https://doi.org/10.21240/merz/2021.4.7
    Source: https://www.merz-zeitschrift.de/article/download/2097/1934
  Lampert, Hoebel, Kuntz et al.: Gesundheitliche Ungleichheiten bei Kindern und Jugendlichen in
    Deutschland: Zeitliche Entwicklung und Trends der KiGGS-Studie. Journal of Health
    Monitoring, 2019. https://doi.org/10.25646/5867
    Source: https://edoc.rki.de/bitstream/176904/5908/1/JoHM_01_2019_Gesundheitliche_Ungleichheiten.pdf

The texts are licensed under CC BY 4.0, like the originals. The recorded HTTP responses in
fixtures/metadata/http come from the public APIs of Crossref, arXiv, OpenAlex and similar
