9. Models downloaded at run time
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model weights are fetched from Hugging Face to the user's machine at a pinned revision when the
feature is used. citegeist does not redistribute them.

  EmbeddingGemma 300M (onnx-community/embeddinggemma-300m-ONNX), the default model of the
    semantic search. Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use,
    https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms, and the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy,
    https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy. The terms apply to whoever downloads
    the weights.
  Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B (onnx-community/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B-ONNX), Apache-2.0, optional model
    of the semantic search.
  bge-reranker-v2-m3 (onnx-community/bge-reranker-v2-m3-ONNX, from BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3),
    Apache-2.0, used when the setting that re-ranks search hits is switched on.
  Models used only by the evaluation command `pnpm eval:retrieval` in a development checkout:
    Xenova/bge-reranker-base (MIT), mixedbread-ai/mxbai-rerank-xsmall-v1 (Apache-2.0),
    onnx-community/embeddinggemma-2-ONNX (Apache-2.0).
  Docling models: docling-project/docling-layout-heron (Apache-2.0),
    docling-project/docling-models (CDLA-Permissive-2.0 and Apache-2.0),
    docling-project/CodeFormulaV2 (CDLA-Permissive-2.0).

