11. Python packages of the conversion worker
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

uv installs the locked packages of workers/convert/uv.lock from PyPI on the user's machine at the
first start. citegeist does not redistribute them. The main packages are Docling (MIT), PyTorch
(BSD-style), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), pypdf (BSD-3-Clause), pypdfium2 (BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0
with bundled libraries), OpenCV (Apache-2.0; the wheel bundles FFmpeg libraries under the LGPL),
trafilatura (Apache-2.0) and lxml (BSD-3-Clause). Packages under weak copyleft licenses:

  certifi, MPL-2.0
  tqdm, MPL-2.0 and MIT
  tld, MPL-1.1 OR GPL-2.0-only OR LGPL-2.1-or-later; citegeist uses the MPL-1.1 option

workers/research uses only the Python standard library.
